</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle rooms, magical traps, and cursed mini-challenges 🧩</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, that one friend who keeps casting fireball in tight corridors 🔥</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the monsters aren’t the real threat. Sometimes it’s Gary with a wand. 😬</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.poster.avif?t=1751786043\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.webm?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/4c8fa9bd123d218bbe0ef8b5aec70646.mp4?t=1751786043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Who is Wand Mart™ for?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughed your way through <strong>Lethal Company</strong> 🤪</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tried to play <strong>Phasmophobia</strong> but your friends ruined the vibe 😱</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy building, casting, screaming, and pretending it’s fine 🛠️</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love horror best when it’s mixed with comedy 😂💀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always wanted to run a shop over ancient evil ruins 👁️</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then yes, this is very much your game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615800/extras/15